{"4438250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Close For The Night", "steam_appid": 4438250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/2ce50f27d28efce6857da34e44f8ea5a.avif?t=1774522373\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras_big/2ce50f27d28efce6857da34e44f8ea5a.webp?t=1774522373 width=1560 height=504 /></span><strong>Close For The Night</strong> is an atmospheric first-person horror game about a blogger exploring mysterious locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character runs a channel where he fulfills requests from his subscribers. They send him addresses of strange houses and places with a disturbing history. He goes there at night with a camera to uncover what is hidden inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location tells a separate story.<br>From isolated homes to sinister buildings with a dark past. The stories are not connected, but every place holds its own secret… and something more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/79333564589ca64f70fd19602a0c59e2.poster.avif?t=1774522373\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/79333564589ca64f70fd19602a0c59e2.webm?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/79333564589ca64f70fd19602a0c59e2.mp4?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmosphere of tension and uncertainty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, clue searching, and gradual story uncovering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal activity and ghosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected events that change your perception of what is happening<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/ecc5f751709533f4d8021716a1aeea37.poster.avif?t=1774522373\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/ecc5f751709533f4d8021716a1aeea37.webm?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/ecc5f751709533f4d8021716a1aeea37.mp4?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no safe places here.<br>The camera records everything.<br>But sometimes it would be better to turn it off…<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/bf94856f64e492a8992cdc2dc4e13faa.poster.avif?t=1774522373\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/bf94856f64e492a8992cdc2dc4e13faa.webm?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/bf94856f64e492a8992cdc2dc4e13faa.mp4?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to close the door… or will you stay for the night?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/2ce50f27d28efce6857da34e44f8ea5a.avif?t=1774522373\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras_big/2ce50f27d28efce6857da34e44f8ea5a.webp?t=1774522373 width=1560 height=504 /></span><strong>Close For The Night</strong> is an atmospheric first-person horror game about a blogger exploring mysterious locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character runs a channel where he fulfills requests from his subscribers. They send him addresses of strange houses and places with a disturbing history. He goes there at night with a camera to uncover what is hidden inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location tells a separate story.<br>From isolated homes to sinister buildings with a dark past. The stories are not connected, but every place holds its own secret… and something more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/79333564589ca64f70fd19602a0c59e2.poster.avif?t=1774522373\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/79333564589ca64f70fd19602a0c59e2.webm?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/79333564589ca64f70fd19602a0c59e2.mp4?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmosphere of tension and uncertainty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, clue searching, and gradual story uncovering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal activity and ghosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected events that change your perception of what is happening<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/ecc5f751709533f4d8021716a1aeea37.poster.avif?t=1774522373\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/ecc5f751709533f4d8021716a1aeea37.webm?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/ecc5f751709533f4d8021716a1aeea37.mp4?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no safe places here.<br>The camera records everything.<br>But sometimes it would be better to turn it off…<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/bf94856f64e492a8992cdc2dc4e13faa.poster.avif?t=1774522373\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/bf94856f64e492a8992cdc2dc4e13faa.webm?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/extras/bf94856f64e492a8992cdc2dc4e13faa.mp4?t=1774522373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to close the door… or will you stay for the night?</p>", "short_description": "Close For The Night is a first-person horror game about a blogger who explores mysterious locations sent by his subscribers. Each place tells its own standalone story filled with dark secrets, paranormal activity, and unexpected events waiting in the shadows.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/157e18f8e4bf9a7ad1d09e8ecd312e91c2e6b7b0/header.jpg?t=1774522373", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438250/752de9c5dbddef44f892b897